### Reindex all in-memory indexes
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/reindex

###

### Deep-ingest all papers: re-fetch topics + save citation edges
POST http://localhost:8080/api/admin/deep-ingest-all?maxRefs=20&delayMs=400

###

### Ingest papers from Semantic Scholar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ingest/s2?query=attention+transformer&limit=20

###

### Deep-ingest single paper by S2 id (replace the id)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ingest/s2/204e3073870fae3d05bcbc2f6a8e263d9b72e776?maxRefs=30

###

### Cold-start recommendations (no user)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend?k=15

###

### Recommendations with text query
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend?q=BERT+language+model&k=15

###

### Recommendations for a specific user
GET http://localhost:8080/api/recommend?userId=REPLACE_WITH_UUID&k=15

###

### List all papers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/papers

###

### Create user
POST http://localhost:8080/api/users
